# Everything here is built by tools/screensim, which has to be able to read its own output back:
# keep it out of Git LFS, the same exemption resources/images/ uses for the build icons. It is all
# small -- a couple of kilobytes a still, tens for an animation -- because every frame is a handful
# of GColor8 levels.
*.png  !filter !diff !merge -text
*.gif  !filter !diff !merge -text
